content:
Solubility from the saturated 41% solution:
\[
\frac{41\text{ g sugar}}{59\text{ g water}}
\]
For 220 g of water:
\[
\text{dissolved sugar}=\frac{41}{59}\times 220=\frac{9020}{59}\approx 152.88\text{ g}
\]
Undissolved sugar:
\[
280-\frac{9020}{59}=\frac{7500}{59}\approx 127.12\text{ g}
\]

\boxed{\frac{7500}{59}\text{ g} \approx 127.12\text{ g}}
